# Commit messages

- Start every commit subject with the company name: `STF: <what changed>`.
- Never mention AI, assistants, Cursor, or any tool in the message.
- Never add `Co-authored-by` or any other trailer.
- After committing, verify with `git log -1 --format=%B`; if a trailer appears, remove it before pushing.

```text
✅ STF: Update hero subtitle on home page
❌ Update hero subtitle (AI-assisted)
❌ STF: Update hero subtitle

   Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
```
